<title>FRANCE: TPS has more than 10,000 subscription requests.</title>
<headline>TPS has more than 10,000 subscription requests.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The TPS digital satellite television broadcaster has received more than 10,000 subscription requests, chairman Patrick Le Lay said.</p>
<p>Le Lay was &quot;very satisfied with the daily subscription rates&quot;, he told a newsconference.</p>
<p>TPS is a joint venture of TF1, France Television, France Telecom, Lyonnaise des Eaux, M6 and Luxembourg's CLT.</p>
